- Original advisory: GHSA-r7fx-8g49-7hhr
- Fix commit: `5a12f9be8` (`system/src/Grav/Common/Media/Traits/MediaObjectTrait.php`)
- Unpatched code: `system/src/Grav/Common/Media/Traits/MediaObjectTrait.php` lines 519–524
